            "text": "theorem normalized_test_negative {a b w : ℝ} (ha : 0 < a)\n    (hcriterion : 2 * b * w + b ^ 2 / a + (a - 2) * w ^ 2 < 2) :\n    (a * (1 + (b / a) ^ 2) - 2) * (w + b / a) ^ 2 -\n      2 * (1 - b * w / a) ^ 2 < 0"
